# Color Up records a real financial history, and none of it belongs here. The
# app keeps sessions in the browser and writes files only when the user exports
# one by hand, so nothing should ever appear in the tree — this is the guard
# against an export being saved into the repo and swept up by `git add -A`.
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.csv
data/
backups/

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
*.swp
